### Andrés intenta pagar la reserva de Camila
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/pagos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAndres.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "id_reserva": {{reservaCamila.response.body.$.id_reserva}},
  "clave_idempotencia": "pago-reserva-{{reservaCamila.response.body.$.id_reserva}}",
  "medio": "nequi",
  "resultado": "aprobado"
}

### Camila paga su reserva
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/pagos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCamila.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "id_reserva": {{reservaCamila.response.body.$.id_reserva}},
  "clave_idempotencia": "pago-reserva-{{reservaCamila.response.body.$.id_reserva}}",
  "medio": "nequi",
  "resultado": "aprobado"
}

