### Rechazar sin motivo
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/admin/publicaciones/{{publicacionLaura.response.body.$.id_publicacion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "decision": "rechazada"
}

